{"data":{"product":{"id":"gid://shopify/Product/7535320465505","title":"White Lace Mommy and Me Dresses — Cami Dress","handle":"white-lace-mommy-and-me-dresses","publishedAt":"2026-04-23T03:53:25Z","onlineStoreUrl":"https://www.dresslikemommy.com/products/white-lace-mommy-and-me-dresses","descriptionHtml":"<ul>\n  <li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> Soft cotton blend with airy lace inserts — breezy, breathable, and gentle against the skin on warm days.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> A picture-perfect matching cami dress for mom and daughter — built for brunch, birthdays, beach days, and holiday cards.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Print:</strong> \"White Lace\" — clean creamy white with openwork lace panels, crochet-style trims, and a scalloped tiered hem.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> V-neck cami silhouette, adjustable shoulder straps, empire waist with lace cutouts, flowy tiered midi/maxi skirt.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Machine wash cold on gentle, hang dry in the shade, no bleach, warm iron inside-out if needed.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Kids Child 3 Years to Child 9-10 Years; Mother S and Mother M.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Size Chart — Dress</h3>\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Size</th>\n      <th>Age</th>\n      <th>Weight</th>\n      <th>Height</th>\n      <th>Chest/Bust</th>\n      <th>Skirt Length</th>\n      <th>Pant/Short</th>\n      <th>Hip</th>\n      <th>Waist</th>\n      <th>Garment Length</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <!-- Children Sizes -->\n    <tr>\n<td>Child 3 Years</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>13–16 kg / 29–35 lbs</td>\n<td>95–105 cm / 37–41 in</td>\n<td>52 cm / 20.5 in</td>\n<td>62 cm / 24.4 in</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>56 cm / 22 in</td>\n<td>52 cm / 20.5 in</td>\n<td>62 cm / 24.4 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4 Years</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>16–19 kg / 35–42 lbs</td>\n<td>105–115 cm / 41–45 in</td>\n<td>56 cm / 22 in</td>\n<td>70 cm / 27.6 in</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>60 cm / 23.6 in</td>\n<td>56 cm / 22 in</td>\n<td>70 cm / 27.6 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5 Years</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>19–22 kg / 42–49 lbs</td>\n<td>115–125 cm / 45–49 in</td>\n<td>60 cm / 23.6 in</td>\n<td>79 cm / 31.1 in</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>64 cm / 25.2 in</td>\n<td>60 cm / 23.6 in</td>\n<td>79 cm / 31.1 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6-7 Years</td>\n<td>6-7</td>\n<td>22–26 kg / 49–57 lbs</td>\n<td>125–135 cm / 49–53 in</td>\n<td>64 cm / 25.2 in</td>\n<td>86 cm / 33.9 in</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>68 cm / 26.8 in</td>\n<td>64 cm / 25.2 in</td>\n<td>86 cm / 33.9 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 8 Years</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>26–32 kg / 57–70 lbs</td>\n<td>135–145 cm / 53–57 in</td>\n<td>68 cm / 26.8 in</td>\n<td>94 cm / 37 in</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>72 cm / 28.3 in</td>\n<td>68 cm / 26.8 in</td>\n<td>94 cm / 37 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 9-10 Years</td>\n<td>9-10</td>\n<td>32–38 kg / 70–84 lbs</td>\n<td>145–155 cm / 57–61 in</td>\n<td>72 cm / 28.3 in</td>\n<td>102 cm / 40.2 in</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>76 cm / 29.9 in</td>\n<td>72 cm / 28.3 in</td>\n<td>102 cm / 40.2 in</td>\n</tr>\n    <!-- Adult Sizes -->\n    <tr>\n<td>Mother S</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>50–58 kg / 110–128 lbs</td>\n<td>155–165 cm / 61–65 in</td>\n<td>90 cm / 35.4 in</td>\n<td>118 cm / 46.5 in</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>96 cm / 37.8 in</td>\n<td>88 cm / 34.6 in</td>\n<td>118 cm / 46.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother M</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>58–65 kg / 128–143 lbs</td>\n<td>160–170 cm / 63–67 in</td>\n<td>96 cm / 37.8 in</td>\n<td>120 cm / 47.2 in</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>102 cm / 40.2 in</td>\n<td>94 cm / 37 in</td>\n<td>120 cm / 47.2 in</td>\n</tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Say hello to the White Lace Mommy and Me Dresses — an airy cami set that turns sunny mornings and salt-water afternoons into a matching moment. Lightweight cotton blend keeps you both cool, while lace inserts, crochet trims, and a tiered flowy hem add the picture-perfect details. Adjustable straps make it fit just right, and the clean creamy palette styles with straw hats, sandals, or a little basket bag.</p>\n\n<p>Inspired by coastal summers and garden weddings, this matching cami dress was made for brunch tables, beach boardwalks, seaside sunsets, and holiday-card backdrops. Slip into yours, twirl with your little one, and make every moment match — from first-day-of-summer photos to everyday family memories you'll want to keep forever.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n<strong>Breezy cotton blend:</strong> Soft, lightweight weave that moves with you on warm days.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Delicate lace details:</strong> Openwork panels, crochet-style trims, and a scalloped tiered hem.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Flattering cami fit:</strong> V-neck, adjustable straps, and an empire waist for a graceful silhouette.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Mom + mini matching:</strong> Identical styling across kids and mother sizes for head-to-toe family twinning.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Photo-ready neutrals:</strong> Creamy white base styles with straw hats, woven bags, and any vacation backdrop.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Slip into the softest matching moment of the summer — grab your set and make every family photo picture-perfect.</p>","seo":{"title":"Mommy & Me White Lace Cami Dress | Dress Like Mommy","description":"Shop our White Lace matching mommy-and-me dresses — cotton-blend cami dress for mom + daughter. Kids 3Y–10Y, Mom S–M."},"productType":"Dresses","tags":["Beach","Cami Dress","Child 2-3yr","Child 4-5yr","Child 6-8yr","Child 9-10yr","Cotton","Cotton Blend","Cream","Crochet","Dresses","Eyelet","Holiday","https://detail.1688.com/offer/1032400758007.html","Ivory","Lace","Matching Family Dress","Matching Family Dresses","Maxi Dress","Maxi Dresses","Midi Dress","Midi Dresses","Mom Size M","Mom Size S","Mommy and Me","Resort","Summer","Summer Dress","Sundresses","Tiered","Vacation","White"],"collections":{"nodes":[{"handle":"dresses","title":"Dresses"},{"handle":"maxi-dresses","title":"Maxi Dresses"},{"handle":"midi-dresse